{"recordId":"emperor_元善見_286991261","name":"元善見","type":"emperor","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"東魏孤帝","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"魏孝静帝","pageId":124408,"revisionId":91072176,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-01-11T13:12:26Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AD%8F%E5%AD%9D%E9%9D%99%E5%B8%9D","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91072176","wikidataId":"Q1149239","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"魏书·卷十二·帝纪第十二","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北史·卷五·魏本纪第五","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"资治通鉴·卷第一百六十四","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"资治通鉴·卷第一百六十","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:05.169Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:zhoushu","source:weishu","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-c5a9eaf03d630f3f","query":"元善見","count":1,"offset":7069,"excerpt":"，遣其世子嶚為質。及楊忠擒仲禮，繹懼，復遣其子方平來朝。\n\n夏五月，齊文宣廢其主元善見而自立。\n\n秋七月，太祖率諸軍東伐，拜章武公導為大將軍，總督留守諸軍事，屯涇北以鎮關中。\n\n九月丁巳，軍出長安。時連雨，自秋及冬，諸軍馬驢多死。遂於弘農北造橋濟","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-3385d164a0fbced2","query":"元善見","count":1,"offset":5034,"excerpt":"作「兄」。按墓誌集釋有元寶建墓誌〔圖版一九二〕，即「景植」。其人為清河王亶子，與元善見孝靜帝為同母兄弟。「子」字訛，今據北史改。〕皇弟威為清河王，謙為潁川王。六月壬子，大司馬華山王鷙薨。〔六月壬子大司馬華山王鷙薨　按元鷙附卷一四高涼王孤傳補，傳稱","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-6bd24dfa4bf99ce9","query":"元善見","count":1,"offset":6791,"excerpt":"。壬申，遣其行台左丞王偉等詣建康說上曰：「鄴中文武合謀，召臣共討高澄。事洩，澄幽元善見於金墉，殺諸元六十餘人。河北物情，俱念其主，請立元氏一人以從人望，如此，則陛下有繼絕之名，臣景有立功之效。河之南北，為聖朝之邾、莒；國之男女，為大梁之臣妾。」上","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":3,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:zhoushu-c5a9eaf03d630f3f","bookId":"book:zhoushu","requestedTitle":"周書/卷02","title":"周書/卷02","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B702","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432557","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B702?action=history","revisionId":2432557,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-07-05T14:25:30Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:48:01.924Z","sha256":"752fd8a40e84ddb6deb291a4fca1147237392ca2d9f3a682d4dc9dd52c7c317b","textSha256":"811d68b5ff0464006c3a2b505fc98c0b1610b7529596fb0816b4b94224264cdb","expandedWikitextSha256":"752fd8a40e84ddb6deb291a4fca1147237392ca2d9f3a682d4dc9dd52c7c317b","characters":10839,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/zhoushu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.382Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/793bc8c0253531161c3d.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/793bc8c0253531161c3d.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:weishu-3385d164a0fbced2","bookId":"book:weishu","requestedTitle":"魏書/卷12","title":"魏書/卷12","sourceUrl":"